diff --git a/gamefiles/ViceExtended/stats/readme.txt b/gamefiles/ViceExtended/stats/readme.txt
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..f10e836a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gamefiles/ViceExtended/stats/readme.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+-------------
+Folder Info
+
+This is where the stats.html and stats.txt get output when saved from the game.
+
+The revc-stat-export-base.html file is required for the game to be able to export the stats to the file.
+And the revc-stat-export-base.css file contains the custom CSS for the stats.html file.
+
+You can easily change the text color by setting some of the values in the CSS.
+It is recommended to leave the html file alone, it is setup a specific way for the games code to read it.
+
+-------------
+Technical info
+
+I hated how the game was using the C++ code for the output html, which made this a pain to debug and change.
+So I made it read from a base template which will be added into from CMenuManager::ExportStats() in Frontend.cpp.
